  <mdb:resourceLineage>
    <mrl:LI_Lineage>
      <mrl:statement>
        <gco:CharacterString>Distinct catchment objects created with UUIDv7 IDs; original polygon coordinates and source identifiers retained. reference_reach_id links each catchment to its reach. Publication repair reorganized self-touching rings in 979 polygons into valid exterior/interior rings. Coordinate sets, boundary point sets, polygon-part counts, IDs and all nongeometry source attributes were preserved. Linework and structure make_valid results agreed. Original validity and repair method are recorded per feature; original source datasets are unchanged.</gco:CharacterString>
      </mrl:statement>
      <mrl:source>
        <mrl:LI_Source>
          <mrl:description>
            <gco:CharacterString>HydroSHEDS v2r0 BAS beta</gco:CharacterString>
          </mrl:description>
        </mrl:LI_Source>
      </mrl:source>
    </mrl:LI_Lineage>
